n = 1000, 256 threads per block: 4 blocks, 1024 threads, 24 do nothing
block 2, thread 3 -> i = 2 * 256 + 3 = 515: adds this element
block 3, thread 255 -> i = 3 * 256 + 255 = 1023: bounds check stops it
n = 300, 128 threads per block: 3 blocks, 384 threads, 84 do nothing
n = 1048576, 256 threads per block: 4096 blocks, 1048576 threads, 0 do nothing
